22
00:01:48,815 --> 00:01:50,065
One has been found.

23
00:01:50,964 --> 00:01:52,787
The rest have never been looked for.

24
00:01:53,685 --> 00:01:55,235
That is the immediate question:

25
00:01:55,456 --> 00:01:57,099
what is in the ground at this site and

26
00:01:57,149 --> 00:01:59,519
the others, and who is walking across it.

27
00:02:03,730 --> 00:02:05,865
Florida ran the same federal program,

28
00:02:06,087 --> 00:02:07,636
and Florida kept records.

29
00:02:08,537 --> 00:02:10,544
The state inventoried more than three thousand

30
00:02:10,594 --> 00:02:11,494
