31
00:02:12,352 --> 00:02:13,797
When it tested twelve of them,

32
00:02:13,993 --> 00:02:16,349
eleven failed the soil standard for arsenic.

33
00:02:17,248 --> 00:02:20,192
Its own report notes the abandoned vats were reused

34
00:02:20,243 --> 00:02:22,601
as pesticide mixing pits and as swimming holes

35
00:02:22,651 --> 00:02:23,551
for children.

36
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:26,063
Florida found them, fenced them,

37
00:02:26,284 --> 00:02:27,184
and cleaned them up.

38
00:02:28,055 --> 00:02:30,503
California never inventoried a single one.

39
00:02:34,730 --> 00:02:36,371
Here is what a station looked like,

40
00:02:36,657 --> 00:02:38,506
rebuilt to the federal drawings.

41
00:02:39,407 --> 00:02:40,748
Pens to hold the herd.

42
00:02:41,646 --> 00:02:42,792
A chute to the vat.

43
00:02:43,690 --> 00:02:45,435
Twenty-six feet long at the rim,

44
00:02:45,618 --> 00:02:47,050
six and a half feet deep,

45
00:02:47,271 --> 00:02:49,328
holding roughly two thousand gallons.

46
00:02:50,227 --> 00:02:52,844
The instructions came printed in a federal circular:

47
00:02:53,052 --> 00:02:55,581
eight pounds of arsenic trioxide for every five

48
00:02:55,631 --> 00:02:58,274
hundred gallons of water, poured in by hand.

49
00:02:59,172 --> 00:03:01,373
Every animal driven through, head under,

50
00:03:01,568 --> 00:03:02,818
and out the other side.

51
00:03:03,716 --> 00:03:06,321
Every fourteen days, for five years.

52
00:03:07,219 --> 00:03:09,239
Then a dripping pen, where the dip ran off

53
00:03:09,289 --> 00:03:11,099
the cattle and back into the ground.

54
00:03:11,998 --> 00:03:13,378
When the timber rotted away,

55
00:03:13,638 --> 00:03:15,201
only the concrete survived.

56
00:03:16,099 --> 00:03:18,328
The outline we found matches the floor of this

57
00:03:18,378 --> 00:03:19,278
vat.

58
00:03:31,530 --> 00:03:34,030
One station could not dip a herd this size.

59
00:03:34,931 --> 00:03:37,600
The federal cadence required three to seven vats,

60
00:03:37,821 --> 00:03:39,957
spread across the ranch's water points.

61
00:03:40,855 --> 00:03:42,418
Only one has been found.

62
00:03:45,310 --> 00:03:46,977
The record is not a rumor.

63
00:03:47,877 --> 00:03:50,536
The federal circular names Orange County as heavily

64
00:03:50,586 --> 00:03:53,166
infested, and reports a single ranch of about

65
00:03:53,216 --> 00:03:55,640
twenty-one thousand head still under quarantine

66
00:03:55,690 --> 00:03:56,783
in 1910.

67
00:03:57,682 --> 00:03:59,924
The family's own history puts the herd at more

68
00:03:59,974 --> 00:04:01,458
than twenty-five thousand.

69
00:04:02,356 --> 00:04:03,632
Run the arithmetic.

70
00:04:04,531 --> 00:04:06,877
Twenty-five thousand cattle, dipped every two

71
00:04:06,927 --> 00:04:09,572
weeks, for five years, in a dip that was

72
00:04:09,622 --> 00:04:12,461
one part arsenic to every sixty parts water.

73
00:04:13,359 --> 00:04:15,887
Between six thousand seven hundred and thirty-nine

74
00:04:15,937 --> 00:04:18,359
thousand pounds of arsenic went into that dip.

75
00:04:19,257 --> 00:04:20,442
Arsenic is an element.

76
00:04:21,341 --> 00:04:22,838
It does not break down.

77
00:04:23,737 --> 00:04:24,1000
It does not go away.

78
00:04:25,898 --> 00:04:29,077
Whatever was introduced in 1907 is still somewhere

79
00:04:29,127 --> 00:04:30,247
on this landscape.

80
00:04:31,145 --> 00:04:33,125
If a vat stood where this concrete is,

81
00:04:33,359 --> 00:04:35,158
one to eight thousand pounds of it would be

82
00:04:35,208 --> 00:04:37,265
concentrated in the vat, the pens,

83
00:04:37,487 --> 00:04:38,387
and the corrals:

84
00:04:38,554 --> 00:04:41,135
hundreds of times the natural background of California

85
00:04:41,185 --> 00:04:43,361
soil, in an area the size of a few

86
00:04:43,411 --> 00:04:44,311
house lots.

87
00:04:45,182 --> 00:04:46,718
To put that mass in perspective:

88
00:04:46,927 --> 00:04:48,830
a lethal dose of arsenic is measured in a

89
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:49,948
fraction of a gram.

90
00:04:50,350 --> 00:04:55,038
Then, between 1997 and 2007, the ground was graded.

91
00:04:55,938 --> 00:04:57,266
At the peak of construction,

92
00:04:57,488 --> 00:05:00,432
in 2002, more than four in ten acres of the

93
00:05:00,482 --> 00:05:02,592
community were bare, moving earth.

94
00:05:03,490 --> 00:05:05,495
Whatever sat in that soil was cut,

95
00:05:05,639 --> 00:05:08,648
filled, hauled, and spread, with no one testing

96
00:05:08,698 --> 00:05:09,598
for it.

97
00:05:10,014 --> 00:05:11,667
Because no one knew to look.

98
00:05:14,390 --> 00:05:16,890
Soil-bound material moves three ways.

99
00:05:17,791 --> 00:05:19,535
Earthmoving relocates it.

100
00:05:20,434 --> 00:05:21,645
Wind lifts it off bare,

101
00:05:21,814 --> 00:05:23,884
graded ground and carries it downwind,

102
00:05:24,106 --> 00:05:26,436
onto the first homes, the first yards,

103
00:05:26,645 --> 00:05:27,764
the first schools.

104
00:05:28,663 --> 00:05:29,563
And water.

105
00:05:30,317 --> 00:05:32,754
Rain and irrigation wash the finest particles

106
00:05:32,804 --> 00:05:35,019
down the drainage, where they settle wherever

107
00:05:35,069 --> 00:05:37,962
the flow slows, and where today's runoff is captured

108
00:05:38,012 --> 00:05:40,293
and sprayed back across the community's slopes

109
00:05:40,343 --> 00:05:41,243
and parks.

110
00:05:41,970 --> 00:05:43,350
None of this has been measured.

111
00:05:44,249 --> 00:05:45,317
That is the point.

112
00:05:50,430 --> 00:05:51,888
On the walk down to the vat,

113
00:05:52,045 --> 00:05:53,295
there is a tire swing.

114
00:05:54,195 --> 00:05:56,070
This is a place where children play.

115
00:05:56,969 --> 00:05:59,340
This ground should be tested and secured by the

116
00:05:59,390 --> 00:06:02,361
State of California, independently of Ladera Ranch

117
00:06:02,411 --> 00:06:04,013
and of Rancho Mission Viejo.

118
00:06:07,430 --> 00:06:09,346
Below the vat site, at the edge of the

119
00:06:09,396 --> 00:06:11,284
golf course, there is a pond.

120
00:06:12,185 --> 00:06:14,557
The federal survey mapped standing water here

121
00:06:14,607 --> 00:06:15,909
in 1968:

122
00:06:16,117 --> 00:06:18,617
a stock-water point, where cattle would have gathered.

123
00:06:19,515 --> 00:06:21,640
Follow the same ground back through the aerial

124
00:06:21,690 --> 00:06:22,590
record.

125
00:06:23,161 --> 00:06:24,385
2025.

126
00:06:24,567 --> 00:06:25,752
2004.

127
00:06:26,651 --> 00:06:28,031
1969.

128
00:06:28,265 --> 00:06:29,685
1947.

129
00:06:30,583 --> 00:06:32,015
1937.

130
00:06:32,263 --> 00:06:33,630
1929.

131
00:06:34,528 --> 00:06:36,403
This corridor was never graded.

132
00:06:37,302 --> 00:06:39,531
Whatever washed down this slope for a century

133
00:06:39,581 --> 00:06:40,481
settled here.

134
00:06:41,286 --> 00:06:43,226
Look at the dead vegetation around it,

135
00:06:43,435 --> 00:06:44,815
and the fairway beside it.

136
00:06:45,713 --> 00:06:47,836
Its sediment has never been sampled.

137
00:06:52,430 --> 00:06:55,049
A public hiking and biking trail runs directly

138
00:06:55,099 --> 00:06:57,313
past the old fence line and the concrete.

139
00:06:58,213 --> 00:07:00,023
Families use it every weekend.

140
00:07:00,922 --> 00:07:02,523
Until this ground is tested,

141
00:07:02,745 --> 00:07:03,995
the State should close it,

142
00:07:04,138 --> 00:07:06,796
mark it, and sample it under hazardous-materials

143
00:07:06,846 --> 00:07:07,746
protocol.

144
00:07:10,430 --> 00:07:12,344
The drinking water has been checked.

145
00:07:13,245 --> 00:07:15,146
It is imported, it is tested,

146
00:07:15,393 --> 00:07:16,357
and it is clean.

147
00:07:17,255 --> 00:07:18,388
The soil has not.

148
00:07:19,286 --> 00:07:21,617
Not by the developer, not by the county,

149
00:07:21,864 --> 00:07:22,893
not by the state.

150
00:07:23,791 --> 00:07:25,888
Not once, in twenty years.

151
00:07:26,786 --> 00:07:28,700
We have mapped where a vat would have stood,

152
00:07:28,857 --> 00:07:31,046
where the cattle gathered, and where the drainage

153
00:07:31,096 --> 00:07:31,996
settles.

154
00:07:32,620 --> 00:07:34,351
Twenty-three ranked targets.

155
00:07:35,250 --> 00:07:37,554
A negative result would be a real result.

156
00:07:38,453 --> 00:07:40,109
But there is only one way to get any

157
00:07:40,159 --> 00:07:41,109
result at all.

158
00:07:42,008 --> 00:07:43,010
Test the soil.

159
00:07:48,470 --> 00:07:50,842
One more thing, and it is the hardest part

160
00:07:50,892 --> 00:07:51,842
to say carefully.

161
00:07:52,743 --> 00:07:56,779
The homes here were built between 1999 and 2006,

162
00:07:56,949 --> 00:07:59,123
and grading peaked in 2002.

163
00:08:00,022 --> 00:08:02,730
Families moved in while the earth was still moving.

164
00:08:03,628 --> 00:08:05,634
Some of those families were expecting.

165
00:08:06,532 --> 00:08:09,683
Ewing sarcoma is a cancer of childhood and adolescence,

166
00:08:09,917 --> 00:08:11,623
and the science on it has changed.

167
00:08:12,522 --> 00:08:15,597
A model published in 2025 proposes a two-step

168
00:08:15,647 --> 00:08:16,378
disease:

169
00:08:16,428 --> 00:08:18,329
an initiating event before birth,

170
00:08:18,576 --> 00:08:20,803
and emergence years later, in puberty.

171
00:08:21,701 --> 00:08:24,516
Separately, studies in Chile have shown that arsenic

172
00:08:24,566 --> 00:08:27,198
exposure in the womb can cause cancers that surface

173
00:08:27,248 --> 00:08:28,225
decades later.

174
00:08:29,123 --> 00:08:31,011
Those are two separate findings.

175
00:08:31,910 --> 00:08:34,305
No study has ever connected them to each other,

176
00:08:34,540 --> 00:08:35,699
or to this community.

177
00:08:36,597 --> 00:08:38,094
I am not an oncologist.

178
00:08:38,993 --> 00:08:41,183
But if my child were diagnosed with one of

179
00:08:41,232 --> 00:08:43,654
these rare cancers, and I knew this history,

180
00:08:43,863 --> 00:08:45,545
I would want to know whether my wife was

181
00:08:45,595 --> 00:08:48,407
here, on this ground, during her pregnancy.

182
00:08:49,305 --> 00:08:50,998
That is not mine to decide.

183
00:08:51,897 --> 00:08:53,511
It could be a Phase 3 study,

184
00:08:53,693 --> 00:08:56,350
with real medical data and real statistics.

185
00:08:57,248 --> 00:08:58,915
It is not our focus now.

186
00:08:59,813 --> 00:09:01,363
Our focus is the ground.

187
00:09:06,470 --> 00:09:08,723
This is an independent research project.

188
00:09:09,623 --> 00:09:11,826
It does not establish that anything caused any

189
00:09:11,876 --> 00:09:12,776
illness.

190
00:09:13,295 --> 00:09:15,914
It asks one question that no agency has ever

191
00:09:15,964 --> 00:09:16,864
asked here.

192
00:09:17,631 --> 00:09:18,531
California:

193
00:09:18,725 --> 00:09:19,727
test the soil.
